[00:00.00] 作词 : Matt Hales/Olivia Dean/Detonate/Tekiva Ledwidge/Sinai Tedros/Andrew Sarlo
[00:00.00][by:AlitaisAlive]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Matt Hales/Olivia Dean/Detonate/Tekiva Ledwidge/Sinai Tedros/Andrew Sarlo
[00:14.80]I've been on a tightrope, walking
[00:14.80]一直小心翼翼地与你相处
[00:18.00]Never had a fear of falling
[00:18.00]没害怕过失败
[00:20.34]Now every step is more unsteady
[00:20.34]现今却如履薄冰
[00:23.79]I've never been so far from solid ground
[00:23.79]仿佛随时都会坠落
[00:26.92]I thought I saw you there to catch me
[00:26.92]以为你会在那儿接住我
[00:29.84]But now I look again, you're out of reach
[00:29.84]再回首 你已远去千里
[00:32.76]There's nothing
[00:32.76]空无一物
[00:34.02]No hands
[00:34.02]孑然一身
[00:35.61]No man for me
[00:35.61]独行踽踽
[00:38.75]Tryna love across a minefield
[00:38.75]避开雷区 努力去爱
[00:41.40]Everywhere I look is no man's land
[00:41.40]目之所及 却均是无依之地
[00:44.60]If you take a step then I will
[00:44.60]你若肯向前一步 我必跟随
[00:47.20]It's harder when you don't know where you stand
[00:47.20]不知身在何方时 步步难行
[00:50.39]I thought that you'd be there to meet me
[00:50.39]以为你会在那儿与我相见
[00:53.05]But now I look again, you're out of reach
[00:53.05]再回首 你已触不可及
[00:55.96]There's nothing
[00:55.96]空无一物
[00:57.50]No hands
[00:57.50]孑然一身
[00:59.09]No man for me
[00:59.09]独行踽踽
[01:02.01]But God, I was hoping
[01:02.01]上帝啊
[01:05.08]Hoping you might just have enough
[01:05.08]这真的够了
[01:07.68]It's not like I'm broken
[01:07.68]难道我就不会崩溃吗
[01:10.59]So what is it you're so scared to touch?
[01:10.59]你究竟在逃避什么
[01:17.17]Why you always giving up?
[01:17.17]为何总是放弃
[01:25.48]Every time I think we're somewhere
[01:25.48]每每以为有所进展
[01:28.13]Close to conversation, it's the same
[01:28.13]窗户纸就快被捅破
[01:31.32]You'd rather be alone and out there
[01:31.32]你又开始疏离
[01:34.24]And let me love a stranger with your name
[01:34.24]如同变了个人
[01:37.17]Why can't you be better for me?
[01:37.17]就不能对我好些吗
[01:39.82]How can I be seen when all I see
[01:39.82]若我目下皆空
[01:43.01]Is nothing
[01:43.01]孤单要怎样才能得到缓解
[01:44.29]No hands
[01:44.29]茕茕孑立
[01:45.87]No man for me
[01:45.87]形影相吊
[01:47.40]Singing
[01:47.40]凄声轻唱
[01:48.93]Nothing
[01:48.93]空空如也
[01:50.26]No hands
[01:50.26]没有一双可以握住的手
[01:51.85]No man for me
[01:51.85]没有一个愿意同行的人
[02:05.09]I know it takes time to heal
[02:05.09]大概得花点工夫才能治愈了吧
[02:10.60]You never had no man for real
[02:10.60]这种从未真正与人相伴的感觉
[02:16.59]I know it takes time to heal
[02:16.59]时间这剂良药啊
[02:22.32]You never had no man for real
[02:22.32]请缓和我彻头彻尾的孤独
